      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is particularly bad with the vive wands, I swear my hands are off by more than 2 inches with the wands because somehow it assumes I'm holding onto the very end of the controller. It's incredibly uncanny.\nOn these screenshots I'm touching my fingertips.\nI've posted about the issue already in the IK-Beta canny, since it was introduced with the new IK.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20/p/add-options-for-manual-hands-offset",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
