      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: It would be disruptive to fix this bug? Come on, get real. Please tell me which one of those fingers in my screenshots is in alignment at all, they are all completely off, it's not even about the angle and it's not even a little bit. There is no trade-off to be made in this particular case. The entire hand is not attached to the correct part of the controller.\nThere are not that many controllers. You got the index, the quest 1 and 2, and the wands as the major ones. Might as well count the Pimax Swords too I guess. Why can't a developer sit down with a set of each controllers and just calibrate this? It sounds like something that shouldn't take longer than an afternoon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
