      "value": "@{6227bbaf8e19345f3a86a491|full_name}: It isn't about the amount of effort! Any change we make (anywhere, not just here) can have huge cascading effects. From our 5+ years of experience developing VRChat, we've discovered that even *slightly* changing things like controller orientation can be extremely disruptive. These changes must be measured, carefully implemented, tested, and given a chance to get feedback before full implementation.\nI understand the desire here, but we've got to consider all users and use cases.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
